{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "09df67ff0425b35cd0552f61ee9afbde4978c38b0d23feff811ec48e1b1e9ec0", "ja": "よかった～。いつもより準備に時間が\nかかっちゃって、ちょっとあせっちゃった。", "zh": "太好了～准备时间比平时长了一点，让我有些着急。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3734329943b4e09a820a745f20044ef9b14e814aefc7cbcff0b172b02edf9386", "ja": "そうだったのか。\nあれ？　もしかして、その服は……。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n咦？难道说，那件衣服是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "aaa7b3c3b62ced36d56ac57eb648dca267bc3da454c9165c9e4a566cd5c2105c", "ja": "うん！　わたしが考えた服だから、\nいっぱい着たいな～って思ってるんだ♪", "zh": "嗯！因为这是我设计的衣服，\n所以我想多穿穿看～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1006_030iku", "source_sha256": "56d75669390cbc42845802979aa6e27ab33df61bbc67c9b807d9b43225980f48", "ja": "それに、ただ着てるだけじゃないんだよ？\n着こなし方も、いろいろ工夫してるんだから！", "zh": "而且，不只是穿着而已哦？\n我还在穿搭方式上下了各种功夫呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1007_p", "source_sha256": "22a222255c4cae539a43197ccf278b48b7bb3546c2ae2e7c798415ae8a49625b", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか。\nあ、もしかして……今日も？", "zh": "哦，原来是这样啊。\n啊，难道说……今天也？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1008_030iku", "source_sha256": "4a92ef9c1e1f0184e754f1c76b81b90f9f797a053f8d515fd2732f4e7b0a73b3", "ja": "うん！　おかあさんに髪を結んでもらって、持っていく\nバッグとかメガネは、わたしが選んだんだよ！", "zh": "嗯！头发是妈妈帮我扎的，带来的包包和眼镜都是我自己挑的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "3edf56be457752adf2b29f20b125677ddc2951dc61cf37566b3527eef76ead5b", "ja": "ちゃんとしてたほうが大人っぽく見えるかなって。\nどうかな？　落ち着いたお姉さんに見える？", "zh": "我想，打扮得端庄一点是不是会显得更成熟。\n怎么样？看起来像个沉稳的大姐姐吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b401c9c65e853f842705b4fd857381f8047c840007d82281e043741b4040bf21", "ja": "ああ！　今日は一段と大人っぽく見えるよ。", "zh": "啊！你今天看起来特别成熟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1011_030iku", "source_sha256": "044549debc5426754d4d9050298daf171cc887e74231107d201c7ba6a225ede1", "ja": "えへへ、よかった～♪　わたしもね、着るたびに\n新しい発見があるから、すっごく楽しいの！", "zh": "嘿嘿，太好了～♪我也是呢，每次穿上它都会有新的发现，特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1012_030iku", "source_sha256": "ae9662c44d127e8619285d388cd48659076642a9cc2f1fd6903befd8b648d554", "ja": "この服を着たら、\nいつでも大人っぽいわたしになれちゃうんだもん。", "zh": "穿上这身衣服，就能随时变成成熟的大人了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "21fe0fabfb2799f262a3c4262e15b6db170e726b1e36a8cd89d1b8eeb087cfe3", "ja": "本当は毎日着たいんだけど……\nおせんたくが大変だからダメって言われちゃった。", "zh": "其实我每天都想穿……可是大家说洗起来很麻烦，不让我穿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2994aa0d621ce4c19c1c349b5d4ef4cdd6e37910191cb7014284b01fc643563c", "ja": "た、確かに……。\nでも、それだけ育が気に入ってくれて、よかったよ。", "zh": "确、确实……。\n不过，育这么喜欢，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1015_030iku", "source_sha256": "a11064b654077f474c595595ac3970063bb1033d9aac07b33bf3a4554aec1829", "ja": "うん、すっごく気に入ってるよ♪\nわたしが大きくなっても着たいなって……。", "zh": "嗯，我超级中意的哦♪\n甚至想着就算等我长大了也想穿……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1016_030iku", "source_sha256": "43a93c5dc85cfc662e12b3110c60ec04b207c954bc5c32af923e731f7c3c81eb", "ja": "ううん、絶対に着るんだ！\n憧れのお姉さんになりたいって思って考えた服だもん。", "zh": "不，我绝对要穿！\n毕竟这身衣服，可是想着要成为令人憧憬的大姐姐才设计出来的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "fa1f381312d696815d0d58d9aff0e114ffc78bff06fb4b6a4be875dce7739e7b", "ja": "わたしが大きくなって着たら、\n今よりも、もっと似合ってると思うよ！", "zh": "等我长大后穿上它，\n一定会比现在更合适哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1018_p", "source_sha256": "8beb49d7a2b2be094258553815ce80bd2a17f7a16d2cf4234dad00a655aec2c6", "ja": "そうだな。育が憧れた、\n綺麗なお姉さんのイメージだって言ってたもんな。", "zh": "是啊。育之前还说过，这是她憧憬的漂亮大姐姐形象呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6a73f5d8488f9dd87c63cd500d38a16dab56f78ff7107e59e10bd35903d4a617", "ja": "今よりお姉さんになる頃には……\nまた違った魅力が見えてくるかもしれないな。", "zh": "等你变得比现在更像大姐姐的时候……\n或许还能展现出不一样的魅力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "d3bb8918dcc3356e881da157d8c46a32464b5a4033420f73919d291a1605497f", "ja": "えへへ、そうだよ！　だから、これからもいっぱい着て\nもっともっと、オシャレのお勉強するね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，没错！所以今后我也要多多穿这些衣服，继续学习更多更多时尚知识！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_030iku0564_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_030iku0564_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "373978f6e228112b7caf08ada1206f826d3fcad3b7c3b36a2d19a6d92f0d9ed4", "ja": "この服と一緒に、わたしもステキなお姉さんに\nなれるように。一生けんめい、がんばるね！", "zh": "我也要和这件衣服一起，努力成为出色的大姐姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
